      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# IREN_MKZ \u2014 AI Performance & Inference SLO\n\n**Fleet efficiency plus instrumentation truth.** GPU demand and job placement are live. TTFT, inter-token latency, tokens/s, NCCL run results and LLMB metrics are not publishing and are shown as unavailable\u2014not as zero.\n\n[Home](/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Command Center](/d/iren_mkz-command-center?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Live Topology](/d/iren_mkz-topology?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Infrastructure](/d/iren_mkz-infrastructure?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [GPU & NVLink](/d/iren_mkz-accelerators?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Fabric, CVT & Cabling](/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Workloads, Slurm & Validation](/d/iren_mkz-workloads?${__url_time_range})",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Live efficiency and SLO coverage",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Live efficiency and SLO coverage",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Overall current SM utilisation across every reporting GB300 GPU.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Fleet GPU utilisation",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Mean GPU utilisation on trays with a current Slurm cgroup. This does not claim per-GPU allocation.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} and on(node) max by(node)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"}))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Allocated-tray GPU util",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Exact GPUs at zero SM utilisation on a tray carrying a current job.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count((DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} == 0) and on(node) max by(node)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"}))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPUs on allocated trays idle",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Distinct current Slurm job cgroups.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by(jobid)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"}))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Current jobs",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "No TTFT metric family exists. This configured workload publisher is DOWN, so TTFT is unavailable.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",job=\"llmb-job\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "TTFT publisher",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Read-only Slurm job collector health. UP means authoritative scheduler state, exit accounting, resource requests, exact job-node membership, and bounded log parsing are publishing.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(nvis_slurm_collector_success{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Scheduler accounting",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Live workload placement and efficiency",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 9,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Live workload placement and efficiency",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "One row per current job/tray placement from cgroup truth.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "jobid"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open job root cause",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-job-root-cause?var-jobid=${__data.fields.jobid}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "node"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open tray root cause",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-tray-root-cause?var-node=${__data.fields.node}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by(jobid,username,node,rack,su)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Current jobs \u2014 exact tray placement",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cgroup": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "uid": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Present"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Every exact GPU behind the idle KPI, retaining the current job ID and username. This is tray residency, not scheduler GPU binding.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "GPU util"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "gpu"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open GPU root cause",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-gpu-root-cause?var-node=${__data.fields.node}&var-gpu=${__data.fields.gpu}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "jobid"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "targetBlank": false,
                    "title": "Open job root cause",
                    "url": "/d/iren_mkz-job-root-cause?var-jobid=${__data.fields.jobid}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} == 0) * on(node) group_left(jobid,username) max by(node,jobid,username)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Allocated-tray GPUs at 0% SM",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Hostname": true,
              "Time": true,
              "UUID": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "device": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "modelName": true,
              "pci_bus_id": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "GPU util"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Fleet GPU demand and imbalance",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "id": 12,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Fleet GPU demand and imbalance",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Fleet average and p95 SM utilisation by SU identify imbalance and headroom.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg by(su)(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{su}} average",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile by(su)(0.95,DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{su}} p95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPU utilisation by Super Unit",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Current demand on job-resident trays. Legend names state units because percent and watts are intentionally correlated.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg(DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} and on(node) max by(node)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "GPU util %",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(DCGM_FI_DEV_POWER_USAGE{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"} and on(node) max by(node)(cgroup_info{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",jobid!=\"\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "GPU power W",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Allocated-tray utilisation and power",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "SLO and validation instrumentation boundary",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "id": 15,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "SLO and validation instrumentation boundary",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Real target states for workload, scheduler, NCCL/fabric, path, cable and NVLink validation producers. The slurm-job row comes from the read-only collector's own success metric.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Up"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "DOWN"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "text": "UP"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "basic",
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "id": 16,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",job=~\"llmb-job|slurm-node|ufm|ufm-telemetry|ib-identity|ib-lldp|ib-switch-live|ib-cable-issue|nvlmapper\"} or label_replace(nvis_slurm_collector_success{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\"}, \"job\", \"slurm-job\", \"\", \"\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Required publishers",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "cluster": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Up"
            }
          }
