        "content": "There is no live vLLM, NIM, Triton, TTFT, inter-token latency, request latency, queue-depth, token-rate, KV-cache, or model-serving metric family in VictoriaMetrics, and recent Loki streams do not expose TTFT.\n\nA credible SLO needs histogram/counter metrics labelled by `model`, `deployment`, `endpoint`, `jobid`, `node`, and `gpu`: TTFT p50/p95/p99, inter-token latency, end-to-end latency, prompt/generated tokens per second, running/waiting requests, and KV-cache utilization. Until a publisher exists, the status is **UNAVAILABLE**, never 0 ms.",
